<div class="screen">
    <header class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">CALFIT HARDWARE</span><h1>Device center<span class="accent">.</span></h1><p>Receive food photos and captured weight from CalFitBot.</p></div></header>
    <div class="device-hero"><div class="device-glyph">▣</div><h2>CalFitBot</h2><p>The robot handles its camera, scale and height controls. Press CAPTURE on its touchscreen. CalFit opens the food scanner when the photo and measured weight arrive.</p></div>
    <div class="notice info">Reception runs while CalFit is signed in and active on the hotspot network. Open the food scanner for connection status and a manual IP fallback.</div>
    <button class="btn btn-primary full" @onclick="() => OpenScanner.InvokeAsync()">Open food scanner →</button>
    <div class="bottom-whitespace"></div>
</div>
@code { [Parameter] public EventCallback OpenScanner { get; set; } }
